  This is a Fortran program for high spin spectroscopy calculations of          
the Projected Shell Model. This package PSM_EE is for even-even nuclei.         
  The package contains 6 files. Each file is clearly separated from the         
others by a beginning and an ending line. The files are:                        
1. EE_DATA : Input data file                                                    
2. EE_PARA : Include parameter file                                             
3. PSM_EE.F: Source code for even-even nuclei                                   
4. EE_OUT1 : Output file 1                                                      
5. EE_OUT2 : Output file 2                                                      
6. EE_OUT3 : Output file 3                                                      
